        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARFAV, Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This single cylinder entry set features a classic design that is slightly floral while the beading around the perimeter keeps it from being too soft. The Fifth Avenue shape is timeless, its simple design allowing that of the Parthenon Rose to shine. This Grandeur Knobset will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARFAV Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARFAV-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262184\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARFAV Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob",
                "description": "Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob Grandeur PARFAV - The Parthenon Plate With Fifth Avenue Knob is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This single cylinder entry set features a classic design that is slightly floral while the beading around the perimeter keeps it from being too soft. The Fifth Avenue shape is timeless, its simple design allowing that of the Parthenon Rose to shine. This Grandeur Knobset will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
